Package: reducekappa
Title: Reduce Redundant Pathway Enrichment Results Using Kappa Scores
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Anne Marie", "Weitzel", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "weitzela@umich.edu")
Description: Clusters similar gene sets based on kappa similarity scores of
    shared genes, as described in the Metascape paper
    (Zhou et al. 2019 <doi:10.1038/s41467-019-09234-6>). Selects a representative
    term for each cluster and retains relevant pathway information. Supports
    single-trial reduction, cross-trial clustering, and comparative analysis
    across multiple enrichment results.
